3. Proficient in various computer office software including Word, Excel, PPT, etc.; skilled in editing software such as AE, PS, AI, PR, etc.;
4. Strong presentation skills, able to communicate in language that others can understand, express clearly to ensure timely and accurate information delivery, with good aesthetic sense and strong video breakdown capabilities with good rhythm;
